      "text": "🖐🏽 PRINTS DON'T LIE 🤦🏽‍♂️\nAt Port Canaveral, CBP officers apprehended a criminal who thought he could outsmart the system by giving a fake name. Nice try but your fingerprints don't lie.\n\nTurns out he had an active warrant from New York for a parole violation tied to dangerous drugs. Instead of cruising on the high-seas, he lied his way straight into custody.\n#OFOProud🇺🇸",
